 Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"h8h1QvEQruTkBI50NlWsyA","review_id":"a8j4L4fsx9umZ8owIAeqCQ","date":"2013-02-18T21:46:54","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9479210376739502,"text_excerpt":"Best Italian food I've had in New Orleans. Everything my husband and I had was delicious and the ambiance was intimate and refined. Food - we loved everything we tried. We had the bisque in a breadbowl and fried artichoke hearts to start. I had the veal tagliatelle special and my husband had the duck pasta special. They were outstanding. For dessert we had bread pudding, which was delicious. Five star food! Ambiance - this place is very small and can be overly crowded, but we were lucky enough to get a nice table in the corner. We did have to wait, even with a reservation, but that's part of the deal here. Just be prepared. Other than that, the ambiance is comfortable, intimate, and class..."},{"business_id":"h8h1QvEQruTkBI50NlWsyA","review_id":"Q2BMuNUQMJga_eFJhjEjUQ","date":"2014-04-16T14:48:34","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9435372352600098,"text_excerpt":"5 stars because in my opinion Vincent's may be the best Italian in NOLA. Sunday evening 6 pm, had reservations for 4. We were seated right away by the friendly host. He seemed to be walking around checking on tables as well...maybe he was the manager also? I don't know, but he was doing a great job. Our server was friendly and attentive without hovering. (I hate when waiters hover) Now to the food. Nibbled on the breadsticks while we decided what to order. I had the Italian Chicken soup. Really enjoyed this. Had a nice broth, was very flavorful. Bet this soup would work miracles if you were battling a cold. I tasted the Corn and Crabmeat bisque, served in a bread bowl. That too was tasty!..."},{"business_id":"h8h1QvEQruTkBI50NlWsyA","review_id":"q3ocPYTLFLWcpk-0Nzm1Gg","date":"2019-11-23T00:43:01","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9413002729415894,"text_excerpt":"Daaaaalish!!! Went here for lunch last week with a coworker. When i walked in, it felt very cozy. Its a small quaint, traditional Italian restaurant. They offer an extensive lunch menu but I opted to order off the regular menu...was craving eggplant parmesan. I was so pleased with all of it! The garlic bread was crunchy and buttery. The side salad was a big hit...get the vinegarette dressing. The eggplant medallions come on a seperate plate from the spaghetti and sauce. It was a big enough serving for me to have leftovers...tasted damn good even after a reheat. My coworker got the eggplant with a cream sauce of crab n shrimp...equally fantastic. Service was friendly and prompt. Already pl..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"h8h1QvEQruTkBI50NlWsyA","photo_id":"vIrbxqE0VjOG5jczTh28eQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/vIrbxqE0VjOG5jczTh28eQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9003608226776123},{"business_id":"h8h1QvEQruTkBI50NlWsyA","photo_id":"ooYBChbNYhBULq7eaF8GPQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/ooYBChbNYhBULq7eaF8GPQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8147575855255127},{"business_id":"h8h1QvEQruTkBI50NlWsyA","photo_id":"JVpP1Oj9G3eBWZ2U4SJx5w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/JVpP1Oj9G3eBWZ2U4SJx5w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8109898567199707},{"business_id":"h8h1QvEQruTkBI50NlWsyA","photo_id":"2eUqrhSNmYoFK6K961VddA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/2eUqrhSNmYoFK6K961VddA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7915717959403992},{"business_id":"h8h1QvEQruTkBI50NlWsyA","pho